yield: per-serve
ingredients:
  - item: vodka
    mass: 45
  - item: tomato juice
    mass: 90
  - item: lemon juice
    mass: 15
  - item: worcestershire sauce
    mass: 3
    note: few dashes
  - item: tabasco
    mass: 1
    note: few dashes, to taste
  - item: horseradish
    mass: 5
    optional: true
    note: grated or from a jar
  - item: celery salt
    note: pinch
  - item: black pepper
    note: good crack
  - item: celery stick
    note: to garnish
  - item: lemon wedge
    note: to garnish
steps:
  - build everything but the garnish in a glass over ice
  - roll between two glasses to mix — don't shake, it froths the tomato juice and turns it pink and foamy
  - garnish with celery and lemon
notes: |
  Pairs with breakfast/sourdough-skillet — mirrors the tomato and savoury notes already in
  the dish rather than contrasting them.

  Season at the end, not the start. Tomato juice brands vary wildly in salt, so taste before
  adding celery salt.
